    MicroKernel on Android

Simple microkernel being developed targetting
modern-ish em64t with the preferred build host
to be the Termux Android environment.

The vast majoriry of design choices will be taken
from the only microkernel I ever studied, MMURTL
as recommended by an old friend. Some credit,
may also be attributed to seL4*.

Please excuse any typos, all of this was written
on an Android virtual keyboard with very bad
hitboxes.

